{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "937b3c9f-a9e0-850f-bc0e-e9d327c30e3a",
  "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:53:56-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Terrence Sullivan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:46:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:46:39-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Rosa, great, wonderful, thank you for picking up! Terrence Sullivan here. Sorry if I sound muffled, I'm outside and I've got the phone pressed up against my scarf because it's freezing out here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:47:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I can hear that a little. Go ahead, I'll listen close. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:47:12-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay! So I've got a noise problem. There's a delivery truck that pulls up and just idles, engine running, every single morning at dawn. Like quarter of six. Rumbling right under my bedroom window!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:47:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Every morning? How long has this been happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:47:41-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Better part of a month now. I'd say close to four weeks. At first I figured, okay, one-off, a driver running behind. But no, it's every day, regular as a clock!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:48:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And where is this? What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:48:08-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "72 Dean Avenue. Fifth Ward, over by the, um, the corner there. I rent the place, so I'm right on the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:48:23-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "72 Dean Avenue, got it. Do you know whose truck it is? A company name on the side, a store it's delivering to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:48:39-05:00",
      "duration": 30,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful question! It's a white box truck, no big logo that I can read from the window. I think it's dropping at the little market on the corner but I honestly couldn't swear to it. It sits there maybe twenty, twenty-five minutes with the engine going."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:49:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Sorry, say that last part again? You cut out for a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:49:18-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] ...twenty, twenty-five minutes, engine running the whole time. Is that better? I moved the scarf."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:49:30-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anyway, my real question is, should I be calling the police non-emergency line instead of you? I didn't want to bother them at that hour, but maybe that's who handles this!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:49:51-05:00",
      "duration": 38,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. For something happening right now, like the truck is out there at that moment, the non-emergency police line is the right one, because an officer can actually go look. What we can do here is take your complaint down and send it to the right department so there's a record of it being a repeated problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:50:29-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great! So both. Okay. I can do both. Honestly I'd just like somebody to tell the guy to turn the engine off. That's all I want! It's not like I'm asking for the moon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:50:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Is it the same time every day, weekdays only, or weekends too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:51:01-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly weekdays. Saturday sometimes. Sundays, no, thank goodness, I get one morning. Today it was there again, this morning, same time. That's why I'm finally calling!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:51:19-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so Monday today, and it was there. Let me put that in. Do you want to leave a phone number in case someone has questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:51:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure. It's 401-555-0160. That's my cell, so if I don't pick up, leave a message, I'm outside a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:51:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0160, and it's Terrence Sullivan, T-E-R-R-E-N-C-E?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:51:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it, two Rs, two Es, wonderful. Sullivan like it sounds."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:52:04-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. I've got a complaint noted: delivery truck idling around quarter of six, near 72 Dean Avenue, going on about a month. I'll pass it along so it gets in front of whoever follows up on idling and noise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:52:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great! And will somebody actually call me back? Or does it go in the, you know, the pile?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:52:42-05:00",
      "duration": 31,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't tell you exactly when you'd hear back, it depends on who picks it up. But it will be on record under your name and address. And if it's there tomorrow morning, call the non-emergency line while it's happening and mention you've already filed with us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:53:13-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that makes sense. Tomorrow I'll have the phone ready by the window. Maybe I can grab the plate number too, would that help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:53:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It would help a lot. Plate, any company name, and the time it arrives and leaves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:53:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful, I'll write all that down. Thank you, Rosa, I appreciate it! Stay warm in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:53:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Sullivan. Bye now."
    }
  ],
